  "id": "lib-json-predicates",
  "order": 1,
  "title": "JSON predicates of the library (entity, damage source, block, item, tool)",
  "goal": "Port the library's `json/predicate` classes: the data-driven predicates the original's modifier files use (`tconstruct:tag`, `mantle:on_ground`, `tconstruct:has_modifier`, the living entity, damage source, block and tool predicates). Each predicate type is a struct with `from_json` and a `matches` over a small context trait for what only the game knows (an entity's health, whether it is on the ground, a block state's tags). The combinators (`and`, `or`, `inverted`) already exist in src/predicate.rs; build on them and do not duplicate them.",
